{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "5ed4d11b8c69c19843a543584cc211ca153ea093131d7bd8f900822878ce6af2", "ja": "思い出の中の光", "zh": "回忆之中的光芒", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "43b4d00bb90908dfdb473edcdbf3792d7bb15d7c4d0c6021111fa8fa157ab995", "ja": "時間をかけて今の関係になったと語る馬場\n姉妹の話を聞き、まつりは改めておたよりに\n向き合う。そして、公録の日。ふたりは自分\nたちなりの答えを語り、迷えるみんなを応援\nするためにと、新曲を届けるのだった。", "zh": "马场姐妹讲述了两人花了很长时间才建立起如今的关系，听完她们的故事，祭重新认真面对来信。公开录制当天，两人说出了各自的答案，并献上新曲，为那些迷茫中的大家加油打气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_06_1000_se", "source_sha256": "b7d769a933cc8cb3d4f3dc26614c33cd76e85fd1cebd43fb943338373783a379", "ja": "ガチャガチャ、バタン！", "zh": "嘎啦嘎啦，砰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_06_1001_021mat", "source_sha256": "427f02e1f33c07093d72965d937dc233075c1f103aec19ae3fe97da31ae00df5", "ja": "……かりんさん、\n風のように出て行っちゃったのです。", "zh": "……可怜她，\n像一阵风一样跑出去了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_06_1002_039kon", "source_sha256": "2747121deb7bb9c5dc8f2e3e8fabbe6d179735deacdbac484390ab05b0b06a6f", "ja": "普段はもう少し静かなんだけど……まつりちゃんが\n一緒で、テンション上がっちゃったのかしら。", "zh": "平时她还稍微安静一点的……可能是因为有小祭在，情绪就高涨起来了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_06_1003_021mat", "source_sha256": "f73494839ab7c9f86eaf29b04d2ed8f78b62c8694cf96f9b3e77ec76a22c0921", "ja": "そうなのです？", "zh": "是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_06_1004_039kon", "source_sha256": "bc360601f4a20ebb9071aa32088a8a48bf9abae4db0e11e29032391bc4b2e0ef", "ja": "ふふ。……仲良し姉妹って聞いてたのに、\n思ってたのと違ったかしら？", "zh": "呵呵……听说你们是关系很好的姐妹，\n和想象中的不太一样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_06_1005_021mat", "source_sha256": "8c8a53d5532a4d2b344d8a386253c8251db0c243e0d7837fc04473a77f508c7f", "ja": "たしかに、想像とは違ったかもしれないのです。", "zh": "确实，或许和想象中的不太一样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_06_1006_039kon", "source_sha256": "a744e206787a550d322c847038921ceb07e0091454ccb2780ad3dd0579a79db7", "ja": "言いたい放題だったでしょ？　昔はしょっちゅう\nケンカしたし、全然口をきかない時期もあったわ。", "zh": "以前我们可是经常想说什么就说什么呢？还老是吵架，也有过一段时间完全不说话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_06_1007_021mat", "source_sha256": "dc0aab15837352b45135d0374c2a60694532c94a45d54f4dc0383223dac4b119", "ja": "そうなのですね。\n……今のふたりからは、考えられないのです。", "zh": "原来是这样。\n……真难以想象现在的你们两个人会那样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_06_1008_039kon", "source_sha256": "9a5c8a15c0163f60d15cd2c00fc69faf4dbbbc79c080fe4337ff294a7501f59c", "ja": "まあ、私も若かったから。\nカチンと来たり、ムキになったりしてね。", "zh": "哎，毕竟我那时候也年轻嘛。\n一被惹恼就较真起来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_06_1009_039kon", "source_sha256": "a5a155e0bcf3dc4e5d5a9343628b6a7affa4c02fb7747cd6ec7a9aefe90c91c0", "ja": "今は、素直じゃないだけだってわかってるけどね。", "zh": "不过现在我明白了，她只是不坦率而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_06_1010_021mat", "source_sha256": "9a7b392e37dad9fbb23333ce6788075eb7efb1a8d1a34d2b6df9e3d18d0af370", "ja": "素直じゃない……。", "zh": "不坦率……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_06_1011_039kon", "source_sha256": "db5957c9e593e14d658f7241da1be5e84e4ea74ff4cf288a425981a413fae770", "ja": "あの子、言葉だけはたくさん投げかけてくれるから。\nまずはそれとちゃんと向き合って……。", "zh": "那孩子虽然会朝我抛来很多话语。\n但只要先好好去面对那些……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_06_1012_039kon", "source_sha256": "a9e54149a360fc3c199b239e3df9f99616763c92db81164605c80a6e5b7b9f8d", "ja": "ああ、これは困ってるんだな、とか。\n本気で怒ってるとか……謝りたいのかな、とか。", "zh": "啊，比如“原来她是在为难啊”，或者“她是真的生气了”……又或者，是想道歉吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_06_1013_039kon", "source_sha256": "7d81708bc35f19ce01307902eafe53e30ad74020ab5013eac1ca2ce7572e1ad4", "ja": "言葉の中にある気持ちを、ちゃんと見つけられるように\nなってからは、今みたいになったわね。", "zh": "等我学会好好察觉话语中蕴含的心情后，我们才变成现在这样的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_06_1014_021mat", "source_sha256": "ff1680550e972702e95a3e348aaa8145fb4c26789b14b7b44ebf053b65e34ee9", "ja": "……。難しいのです……。", "zh": "……好难啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_06_1015_039kon", "source_sha256": "b22400b78e074679794e06ad9d550dc54c9015fb8785942d2887458bddef6bdf", "ja": "急には、難しいわよね。こういうのって、\n時間がかかるものだと思うわ。", "zh": "一下子确实很难呢。我觉得这种事，\n本来就是需要花时间的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_06_1016_021mat", "source_sha256": "892ba1967257a2ff7b540ac73f375210a3c8d3e5816df076f9ca950e10e558a6", "ja": "でも、今の考え方は、とても参考になったのです。\nあの、おたよりのことだけじゃなくて……。", "zh": "不过，你刚才的想法让我受益匪浅。那个，不只是关于来信的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_06_1017_039kon", "source_sha256": "e47e4f28345057d191c2a0c06689ccfde37dff82ae6da6f4530ff60062e87433", "ja": "よかった。考え方ですこしでも\n楽になれるなら、それが一番だわ。", "zh": "太好了。如果这些想法能让你轻松一些，那就是最重要的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_06_1018_039kon", "source_sha256": "a3c7d05f565c48bf441db16657dd7ff0fb53a516a21819ee01c97b0432165e20", "ja": "まつりちゃん。あのおたより、\nもう一度ふたりで読み直してみましょう。", "zh": "茉莉。那封来信，\n我们两个人再重读一遍看看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_06_1019_021mat", "source_sha256": "ca82a41382afcc2b630e755ee33ccb52c4fc451b65ba6328ed87462e51bac4ff", "ja": "このみちゃん……はいなのです！", "zh": "可爱的木实……好哒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_06_1020_null", "source_sha256": "e703f261dc5b6ab24f64b8513c23e77d0d402b2ccb3f1a9c75d79738b1efa824", "ja": "定期公演当日……", "zh": "定期公演当天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_06_1021_039kon", "source_sha256": "365fe5e48d089022936e480ce0f88052c95f46ec53203ceb97cc34a1b8a354f4", "ja": "みんなー、今日は来てくれてありがとう～！\n公開録音コーナーも、そろそろ終わりの時間よ。", "zh": "大家～，谢谢你们今天过来～！\n公开录音环节也差不多到结束的时间了哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_06_1022_audience", "source_sha256": "7cda9aa6638e93293e0b8966775058f4390a86b608d0a1532e0840bf1a241a31", "ja": "ええ～～～！！", "zh": "诶～～～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_06_1023_021mat", "source_sha256": "b4f0819ef8e428a82954952dae8db28e09e79ba0658af26069cb694bcce7f360", "ja": "姫たちも、みんなとお別れするのは、寂しくて\nうるうるなのです。でも、その前に……。", "zh": "公主和大家分别，也是寂寞得\n眼泪汪汪的呢。不过，在那之前……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_06_1024_021mat", "source_sha256": "66303f404692b68bec649d65218b1f9b3f722f78b02c598960150a9ab97db464", "ja": "最後のおたよりを、紹介させてほしいのです。", "zh": "请让我来介绍最后一封来信。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_06_1025_039kon", "source_sha256": "8f47fe25466d2e4c1fbeeb84b41e3c7e23c4c5f72068288defdf915e282e8427", "ja": "これは私たちが結構悩んだおたよりなの。\nどうか、みんなで聞いてあげてね。", "zh": "这是让我们苦恼了挺久的一封来信。\n请大家一定要一起听听哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_06_1026_021mat", "source_sha256": "bcec22c0744a92f0c33824a501c786232d43ed6f33ca9b7eae03cd8f90f2e118", "ja": "「こんにちは。こういうおたよりは、\n初めて送ります。私の悩みを聞いてください」", "zh": "「你好。我是第一次寄这样的信。\n请听听我的烦恼」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_06_1027_021mat", "source_sha256": "5e3944fa53d8a3072a9a9c870629d2e7fcf6c59eab059f8e4fd8448c37194748", "ja": "「私にはお姉ちゃんがいます。でも最近、\n姉と私は相性が悪いような気がしてきました」", "zh": "「我有一个姐姐。但是最近，\n我总觉得我和姐姐好像合不来」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_06_1028_021mat", "source_sha256": "128cc42dfedc91eba2fd474ff4e96f3f556532d455030ae6268c6575edc2d97d", "ja": "「顔を見ればケンカしてばっかりで、どうして\nそうなったのか、後になると理由も覚えていません」", "zh": "“一见面就总是吵架，至于为什么\n会变成这样，事后甚至连原因都想不起来”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_06_1029_021mat", "source_sha256": "72b132b4f7e01d6c2ea163090761acb436a1ebc015557f636601c16a6aae43bf", "ja": "「本当は、ケンカなんかしたくないです。\n親に相談しても、深刻に受け取ってもらえなくて……」", "zh": "“其实，我一点也不想吵架。\n就算找父母商量，他们也完全不当回事……”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_06_1030_039kon", "source_sha256": "a52e96e88eec1bee7788f7c92d45d77e4e5191364773949e757646287ab9982e", "ja": "とても悩んでいることが、\n伝わってくるおたよりね……。", "zh": "这封来信让人感受到，她真的非常苦恼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_06_1031_039kon", "source_sha256": "8d97a2c7d562ae985a8c27eabe3cfc8da5c8dd3890823e3f0f689dbb8ced47bf", "ja": "悩んでいるのは、この状況をどうにかしたいと\n思っているから……私はそう感じたかしら。", "zh": "之所以这么烦恼，是因为想改变这种状况……我是这么觉得的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_06_1032_021mat", "source_sha256": "3395cf3ad395a76cbefa40f59ab51ffe6954c7e06e0b27a119fddffef3897c21", "ja": "それに、最近と書いてあるということは、\n昔は違ったはずなのでは……そう思うのです。", "zh": "而且，既然写着“最近”，那过去应该是不一样的吧……我是这么想的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_06_1033_021mat", "source_sha256": "f6f114a161c4f48f0540c987477ca838003eff6dc140f6b5bf9e5bf40dcb2e0c", "ja": "仲良しの頃の思い出があるから、今が\n辛いのではないですか？　もしそうなら……。", "zh": "正因为有关系要好时的回忆，现在才会如此难过，不是吗？如果真是这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_06_1034_021mat", "source_sha256": "90f858142595fa56bf891221a2b48a5fb7de65861e032fcc9ecbfcee7853b30c", "ja": "何もしなかったら、後悔してしまう。\n……姫はそう思うのです。", "zh": "如果什么都不做，一定会后悔的。\n……姬是这么想的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_06_1035_039kon", "source_sha256": "8d05182e6c4855725dad40209d5bbe44467b266f437e53ac226f5756660f4d7b", "ja": "そうね。後悔だけはしないように……お姉さんとの\n会話や思い出を、振り返ってみてもいいのかも。", "zh": "是啊。至少不要留下遗憾……不妨回顾一下和姐姐的\n对话与回忆。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_06_1036_039kon", "source_sha256": "12180c227c4408fcc85582cc8064fdc7b60718440757c37bc6764b1853626ee2", "ja": "もしかしたらその中に……今だと気付ける\n気持ちがあったりするかもしれないわ。", "zh": "也许在那些回忆中……就会有你如今\n才能够察觉到的心情呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_06_1037_021mat", "source_sha256": "3b85cb2fe455d6cba3c5012fe5747bef63bb022000225edff90e0132a4259551", "ja": "あなたがお姉さんと、どうしたいか。\n……どうなりたいか。考えてみてほしいのです。", "zh": "希望你想一想，自己想和姐姐怎么相处。\n……想变成什么样的关系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_06_1038_021mat", "source_sha256": "f1394f621517facadc4690fdc1237107976f351ddc67f45600f37059984d7d60", "ja": "きっと、そこに答えはあると思うから。\n……姫たちが言えるのは、これだけなのです。", "zh": "因为我想答案一定就在其中。\n……姬能说的，就只有这些了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_06_1039_039kon", "source_sha256": "f170834992172d5e0fd59bf52f06dbf397ea0e7b3372ff37e9fd84e791e18ed1", "ja": "時間がかかってもいいから、考えてみてね。\nさて、これでお悩み相談も最終回……だけど！", "zh": "就算花点时间也没关系，好好想想吧。\n好了，这次的烦恼咨询也到了最终回……但是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_06_1040_039kon", "source_sha256": "ff294803714e3033287692f3175c7544c9c08064040f2720e63e944451491bd0", "ja": "家族だけでなく、恋愛でも、仕事でも……\n決断が必要な時はきっとあると思うわ。", "zh": "不仅是家庭，恋爱也好，工作也罢……\n我想肯定都会有需要做出决断的时候。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_06_1041_021mat", "source_sha256": "f0e12a4066be97bfd531143d8cbda264f0f7ec77a2a65e49b0184ce8d425c131", "ja": "たとえ立ち止まってしまっても、大丈夫なのです。\n……その時は、姫たちがいるのです。", "zh": "即使停下脚步，也没关系的。\n……因为那时，还有我们这些公主在。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_06_1042_021mat", "source_sha256": "81e064d368d68787cfe60f8d5d62ce7ef2bfdb34ecb6b3c5ffcc19c727f2bd13", "ja": "みんなの気持ちに、寄り添えるように……\n今日は、新曲をお届けするのです！", "zh": "为了能贴近大家的心情……今天就为大家带来新歌哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_06_1043_039kon", "source_sha256": "2d3759c0c136f41c4507f08da810d40623dccffbbfd84cccf61d2fc836b9724b", "ja": "迷えるみんなが、先に進めることを祈って……\nそれでは聞いてください。", "zh": "愿迷茫的大家都能继续前进……那么，请听。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
